-### Private Conversation 0.1.24 — BETA
+### Private Conversation 0.1.25 — BETA
 
 Want two NPCs to talk while the Dragonborn stays out of it? Choose Pair A/B, select **Exclude the player**, choose how to treat bystanders, arm the scene, then send one ordinary Standard direction. The button means the next input; the llama still needs you to point it at the right conversation.
 
 Pair, Group, Free scene, and Solo reflection are available. Optional Personal and Physical actions follow the scene rules; Intimate actions remain subject to CHIM's switches and SHARMAT's consent and safety gates. PCV scopes the current request audience; it does not guarantee physical privacy, erase stored history, or control every model response.
 
-The public 0.1.24 BETA release contains 21 server payload files and changes runtime code. Its [focused verification record](plugins/private_conversation/tasks/read-timeouts-2026-10-26/verification.md) records five focused PHP fixtures, eight syntax checks, an 18/18 owner PostgreSQL suite, a 6/6 exact Department-overlay suite, and four package checks. A clean build from committed source produced five assets byte-identical to the tested candidate. No fresh provider request, installation, or Skyrim gameplay is claimed. See [current beta evidence and limits](plugins/private_conversation/docs/operator-acceptance.md) and the [0.1.24 release note](plugins/private_conversation/distribution/private_conversation-v0.1.24.md).
